9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,The same few staff are doing all the work. I want to check the staffing levels.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, if the schedule slips, does that affect the final quality?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
