12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, usage is important, but we cannot build if the timeline is impossible.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shunichi, if staff are stretched thin, does that affect the maintenance costs?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, exactly. The routine upkeep is falling on the same tired people.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings in older blocks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
