17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the weather days in site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will investigate the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look into the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's see what the data says before we pick a winner.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Agreed. Data over opinion.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
