35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The post-occupancy reviews show spaces are rated highest when anyone can book them.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"That matches my finding. General rooms are always full, specialist ones are idle.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,My data shows weather kills outdoor projects. Six weeks lost to rain and frost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Tender records show mechanical plant costs rose by a fifth. That is a huge jump.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Staffing posts are frozen. Technicians are doing manual checks because the equipment is old.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, so outdoor projects are risky?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, if mechanical costs are rising, that affects the lab upgrade significantly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, very risky. Inspection-driven works were on time, comfort-driven ones slipped.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Victoria, yes. And we have no reserve for replacing old AV kit.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mizuki, the reviews say shared spaces work best. That points to the Commons.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The survey findings in older blocks are bad. Hazardous material adds months.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mizuki, that makes the older blocks a nightmare to renovate.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shunichi, if technicians are overworked, a new lab might just add to their burden.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, true. But the lab upgrade is necessary for safety.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Kenji, safety is key, but we need to consider the staffing impact.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the Central Study Commons. It fits the usage data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I agree. The booking data supports general-purpose spaces.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The Media Center might be good, but the schedule risk is high.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,The Lab Upgrade is expensive due to tender inflation.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,The Path Network is risky due to weather. The Commons seems safest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
